TIERS
-----
  TIER 1  PHONE    sway 0.1-3 Hz + tremor 4-12 Hz + tap reaction variance
                   every device                      BUILDING

  TIER 2  LENS     camera pulse (autocorrelation, rMSSD) + magnifier
                   most devices, needs light         BUILDING

  TIER 3  RING     live HR, HRV, SpO2 over Web Bluetooth
                   laptop Chrome / Android only      ON HOLD - verifying

All three measure the same thing: drift from YOUR OWN baseline.
Tiers 1 and 2 are a complete product without Tier 3.


